From: zyi
Subject: [PATCH] package/strace: bump to 6.6

Buildroot 2022.05 ships strace 5.17, which does not build against the
6.6 kernel UAPI headers used here (BTRFS_EXTENT_REF_V0_KEY was commented
out upstream and strace's xlat tables are built with -Werror). strace 6.6
matches the kernel and builds cleanly. Hash from the tarball published at
https://strace.io/files/6.6/.

This change used to exist only as an in-place edit of
~/tina5/buildroot/upstream-2022.05; fetch-sdk.sh now applies it after
cloning, so a fresh checkout reproduces the image.

---
diff --git a/package/strace/strace.hash b/package/strace/strace.hash
index f3567db6..402439ce 100644
--- a/package/strace/strace.hash
+++ b/package/strace/strace.hash
@@ -1,5 +1,4 @@
-# Locally calculated after checking signature with RSA key 0xA8041FA839E16E36
-# https://strace.io/files/5.17/strace-5.17.tar.xz.asc
-sha256  5fb298dbd1331fd1e1bc94c5c32395860d376101b87c6cd3d1ba9f9aa15c161f  strace-5.17.tar.xz
+# Locally calculated (tarball from https://strace.io/files/6.6/)
+sha256  421b4186c06b705163e64dc85f271ebdcf67660af8667283147d5e859fc8a96c  strace-6.6.tar.xz
 sha256  d92f973d08c8466993efff1e500453add0c038c20b4d2cbce3297938a296aea9  COPYING
 sha256  7c379436436a562834aa7d2f5dcae1f80a25230fa74201046ca1fba4367d39aa  LGPL-2.1-or-later
diff --git a/package/strace/strace.mk b/package/strace/strace.mk
index 4eef43a4..6279622f 100644
--- a/package/strace/strace.mk
+++ b/package/strace/strace.mk
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 #
 ################################################################################
 
-STRACE_VERSION = 5.17
+STRACE_VERSION = 6.6
 STRACE_SOURCE = strace-$(STRACE_VERSION).tar.xz
 STRACE_SITE = https://github.com/strace/strace/releases/download/v$(STRACE_VERSION)
 STRACE_LICENSE = LGPL-2.1+
